# The website in landing/ is the only thing that is ever uploaded to a host.
#
# Everything else here either runs on the clinic's own computer or is internal.
# clinicos-app/data/ holds patient records, and uploading it would break
# invariant 2 in CLAUDE.md — identifiable data never leaves the machine.
#
# This exists as well as .gitignore, not instead of it: a CLI deploy uploads the
# working tree rather than a git commit, so anything untracked but present on
# disk would otherwise go too.

/clinicos-app
/portal
/docs
/artifacts
/_to_delete
/Claude outputs
/.claude

*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.zip
.env
.env.local
